'''Marklus Sterner''' was a [[Podracing|podracer]] [[pilot]] listed as the second place winner of a podrace at [[Grabvine Gateway]] in [[Baroonda (city)|Baroonda]]. When [[Syril Karn]] attempted to gain entry to the [[Imperial office complex]] on [[Ghorman]] after hours, the [[Unidentified Imperial office complex guard 1|two]] [[Unidentified Imperial office complex guard 2|guards]] were watching the race on a [[datapad]] screen, with [[Aurebesh]] text in the lower right hand corner indicating that Sterner was the runner-up, with with the winner being [[Tania Richard]], and [[Scott Pritchard (podracer)|Scott Pritchard]] in the third place.<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?">{{Andor|Ever Been to Ghorman?}}</ref>

==Appearances==
*{{Andor|Ever Been to Ghorman?}} {{C|First mentioned, in [[Aurebesh]], on [[datapad]] screen}}

==Behind the scenes==
The character's name is nearly identical to [[Markus Sterner]], who worked as a CG supervisor on the ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'' episode "[[Ever Been to Ghorman?]]" where the character's name is listed.<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?" />

